cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both this repository and the
  underlying methods listed in THIRD_PARTY.md — the docking and scoring
  are performed by Uni-Dock and gnina.
title: "kepler-dock-cascade: a three-stage multi-GPU pipeline for high-throughput virtual screening"
abstract: >-
  A containerised pipeline that chains ligand preparation (RDKit + Meeko),
  GPU docking (Uni-Dock), and consensus rescoring (gnina CNN scores,
  ΔLin_F9XGB, exponential consensus ranking) into three independently
  runnable stages with crash-resilient restart.
type: software

